@startuml Sequence_CreateSchedule
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Création d'un Emploi du Temps (Admin)

actor Admin
participant "DashboardActivity" as Dashboard
participant "EmploiTempsActivity" as ScheduleList
participant "EmploiTempsEditActivity" as ScheduleEdit
participant "AppDatabase" as DB
participant "EmploiTempsDao" as EmploiDao
participant "UserDao" as UserDao
participant "ModuleDao" as ModuleDao

Admin -> Dashboard: Cliquer sur "Élaborer emploi du temps"
Dashboard -> ScheduleList: Naviguer avec USER_ID
activate ScheduleList

ScheduleList -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ScheduleList -> UserDao: getUserById(USER_ID)
UserDao --> ScheduleList: User (ADMIN)
ScheduleList -> EmploiDao: getAllEmploiTemps()
EmploiDao --> ScheduleList: List<EmploiTemps>
ScheduleList -> ModuleDao: getAllModules()
ModuleDao --> ScheduleList: List<Module>
ScheduleList -> UserDao: getAllUsers()
UserDao --> ScheduleList: List<User>
deactivate DB

ScheduleList -> Admin: Afficher liste des emplois
Admin -> ScheduleList: Cliquer sur "Ajouter"
ScheduleList -> ScheduleEdit: Naviguer avec USER_ID
deactivate ScheduleList
activate ScheduleEdit

ScheduleEdit -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ScheduleEdit -> UserDao: getAllUsers()
UserDao --> ScheduleEdit: List<User> (professeurs)
ScheduleEdit -> ModuleDao: getAllModules()
ModuleDao --> ScheduleEdit: List<Module>
deactivate DB

ScheduleEdit -> Admin: Afficher formulaire
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Sélectionner professeur
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Sélectionner module
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Sélectionner jour
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Sélectionner heures (TimePicker)
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Saisir salle
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Sélectionner type de cours
Admin -> ScheduleEdit: Cliquer sur "Enregistrer"

ScheduleEdit -> ScheduleEdit: Valider les champs
ScheduleEdit -> DB: getDatabase()
activate DB
ScheduleEdit -> EmploiDao: insert(EmploiTemps)
EmploiDao --> ScheduleEdit: Success
deactivate DB
ScheduleEdit -> Admin: Afficher message de succès
ScheduleEdit -> ScheduleList: Retour à la liste
deactivate ScheduleEdit
activate ScheduleList
ScheduleList -> EmploiDao: getAllEmploiTemps()
EmploiDao --> ScheduleList: List<EmploiTemps> (mis à jour)
ScheduleList -> Admin: Afficher liste mise à jour
deactivate ScheduleList
@enduml
